				<div class="section-title" style="padding-top: 12px;"><span class="icon icon-folder"></span> Deal Context</div>
				<small style="display: block; padding-bottom: 4px;">Lets the AI chat look up your deal records and read matching lines from SymBot's own log files when you ask about a deal. Read-only: it can describe deals, never change them. Deal analysis is unaffected.</small>

				<table id="botsCreate" style="margin-top: 5px;" cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0>

				<tr>
					<td>
						<label for="deal_context_router_model">Router Model:
							<span class="toolTip">?<span class="toolTipText">
